             crm:P2_has_type <http://www.lynx.com/resource/technical-diagnostic-feature>;
             rdfs:label ?value
}""" .
  
  _:node1k32orpejx512 <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains> <http://www.lynx-platform.com/field/TechnicalDiagnosticFeatures> .
